  m_Name: IndustrialDocs
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ClueData
  id: 004_industrial_docs
  title: Shipments from Local Warehouse
  description: 'Documents about a lot of shipments to different places, but there''s
    a particularly large volume of shipments to a recycling company in this district.
    The documents don''t say what''s in those boxes — for other shipments, they
    do... Too much volume to be "just tools" like the others...


    I should probably go
    there next. A recycling company buying lots of unregistered shipments? Even
    if it''s not related to the case, it''s worth a look.'
